    "custom_comments": "CFM\n\tJane Doe\nPest\n\tBarefoot Mosquito\n\t9/26\n\nReach-in 38\nWalk-in 39\n\n34 - Observed back door open.  Keep closed at all times to prevent pests entry.\n34 - Observed flies in kitchen.  Have pest control address immediately \n36 - Observed soiled towels out.  Store in sanitizer at all times\n2 - Observed chicken sitting out at room temp.  Chicken temped 76 degrees.  All discarded.\n31 - Observed items in hand sink.  Keep hand sinks clear at all times\n14 - Observed no hand washing during inspection.  Employees must wash hands at all times.\n35 - Observed employees on cookline on cell phones on prep tables.  Do not use cell phones on prep tables\n9 - Observed knife stored in between equipment.  Only store in clean/sanitized location\n42 - Observed soiled vents over cooking area.  Clean immediately\n22 - Observed no food handler certifications on site.  Always provide\n6 - Observed a curry sitting on the small table at room temp.  Must time stamp and discard after 4hours.\n18 - Observed Spray bottle without label. Label. Poisonous/toxic materials or chemicals must be labeled with the common name of the substance.  Recurring violation\n28 - Observed multiple containers of food with no date label. Label all containers with name of product and date item was made. Repeat violation. \n37 - Observed many food containers stored on the floor in the walk in cooler. Food must be stored at least 6 inches above the floor.  Recurring violation\n45- Observed damaged cove tile on the floor neat the floor drain. Repair. Recurring violation\n30 - Observed expired permit posted. Post Updated food establishment permit in public view.",
